= Overview =

PKI provides CLI to manage user memberships. All user membership commands must be executed as an administrator.

= Commands =

== Listing user memberships ==

<pre>
% pki <administrator authentication> user-find-membership <user ID>
</pre>

== Adding user membership ==
<pre>
% pki <administrator authentication> user-add-membership <user ID> <group ID>
</pre>

== Deleting user membership ==

<pre>
% pki <administrator authentication> user-remove-membership <user ID> <group ID>
</pre>

